        "raw": "<p>Close, but not quite. You have the replacement part correct - the first half of the power will result in 1 City and 5 Explorers.</p>\r\n<p>The damage part is slightly different than you describe. Explorers damage buildings (Towns and Cities) and buildings damage Explorers, but Explorers do not damage other Explorers (nor do buildings damage other buildings).</p>\r\n<p>So in your example, the 5 Explorers deal 5 damage to the City, destroying it (the extra 2 damage is lost) and the City deals 3 damage to the Explorers (destroying 3 Explorers). The result is 2 Explorers, which are then pushed out of the target land.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
